1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,013
One hot day... and a thirsty garden.

2
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,438
Brother Cloud, please give me some water!

3
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
Coming right up!

4
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,361
Oh no! I'm much too small.

5
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,072
Don't give up! Come on, let's sing together!

6
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,800
Hooray! The rain is here!

7
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:49,587
With friendship and courage, anything is possible!
